#. module: bf_securetransfer_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_securetransfer_privacy/models/secure_transfer.py:0
msgid ""
"\n"
"Trigger recorded in the access log: %s"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Déclencheur consigné au journal d'accès : %s"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_securetransfer_privacy/models/secure_transfer.py:0
msgid "(unnamed)"
msgstr "(sans nom)"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_securetransfer_privacy/models/secure_transfer.py:0
msgid "Content uploaded by the sender: not classified, categories unknown"
msgstr "Contenu déposé par l'expéditeur : non classifié, catégories inconnues"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_securetransfer_privacy/models/secure_transfer.py:0
msgid ""
"Retention period of the secure transfer, applied by the module's purge job. "
"Section 23 of the Quebec private sector privacy act: personal information is"
" destroyed once the purpose for which it was collected has been achieved."
msgstr ""
"Durée de conservation du transfert sécurisé, appliquée par le cron de purge "
"du module. Art. 23 LPRPSP : le renseignement est détruit lorsque la fin pour"
" laquelle il a été recueilli est accomplie."

#. module: bf_securetransfer_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_securetransfer_privacy/models/secure_transfer.py:0
msgid ""
"Secure transfer \"%(transfer)s\": %(count)s file(s) deleted from object storage (%(origin)s).\n"
"Files: %(names)s"
msgstr ""
"Transfert sécurisé « %(transfer)s » : %(count)s fichier(s) supprimé(s) du stockage objet (%(origin)s).\n"
"Fichiers : %(names)s"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_securetransfer_privacy/models/secure_transfer.py:0
msgid "abandoned draft, collected by the automatic clean-up"
msgstr "brouillon abandonné, récolté par le ménage automatique"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_securetransfer_privacy/models/secure_transfer.py:0
msgid "expired transfer, purged by the retention job"
msgstr "transfert expiré, purgé par le cron de rétention"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_securetransfer_privacy/models/secure_transfer.py:0
msgid "uploaded files (object storage)"
msgstr "fichiers déposés (stockage objet)"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_privacy
#: model:privacy.purpose,name:bf_securetransfer_privacy.purpose_securetransfer
msgid "File delivery by secure transfer"
msgstr "Remise de fichiers par transfert sécurisé"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_privacy
#: model_terms:privacy.purpose,plain_language_summary:bf_securetransfer_privacy.purpose_securetransfer
msgid ""
"When a document is delivered to you through a secure link, the\n"
"                file is placed on encrypted storage and the link that leads to\n"
"                it expires on a date set in advance. Your email address is used\n"
"                to send you this link and to record who downloaded what, and\n"
"                when."
msgstr ""
"Lorsqu'un document vous est remis par lien sécurisé, le\n"
"                fichier est déposé sur un stockage chiffré et le lien qui y\n"
"                mène expire à une date fixée d'avance. Votre adresse courriel\n"
"                sert à vous adresser ce lien et à consigner qui a téléchargé\n"
"                quoi, et quand."

#. module: bf_securetransfer_privacy
#: model_terms:privacy.purpose,plain_language_summary:bf_securetransfer_privacy.purpose_securetransfer
msgid ""
"Once the expiry date has passed, the file is deleted from the\n"
"                storage. The access log and the transfer record are kept without\n"
"                the content, because they are the proof of what was\n"
"                delivered."
msgstr ""
"Passé la date d'expiration, le fichier est supprimé du\n"
"                stockage. Le journal des accès et la fiche du transfert sont\n"
"                conservés sans le contenu, parce qu'ils font la preuve de ce\n"
"                qui a été remis."

#. module: bf_securetransfer_privacy
#: model:ir.module.module,shortdesc:base.module_bf_securetransfer_privacy
msgid "Secure Transfer: Privacy Bridge (Quebec Law 25)"
msgstr "Transfert sécurisé : pont vie privée (Loi 25)"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_privacy
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_bf_securetransfer_privacy
msgid ""
"Record in the destruction register what the secure transfer purge already "
"deletes, and declare the purpose in the register of processing activities"
msgstr ""
"Inscrire au registre de destruction ce que la purge du transfert sécurisé "
"supprime déjà, et déclarer la finalité au registre des traitements"
